  lines:
  - text: "Drawing its name from Fray Diego Berga\xF1o\u2019s 1732 Kapampangan dictionary"
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: where it originally denoted a sour fruit snack this dish later transformed
      in 1974 Angeles City,
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'alongside the post-war economic presence of Clark Air Base. '
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Can you handle the careful chop and the fiery heat?
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
